- Base: **`feature/refactoring6`** unless user says otherwise.
- New branches: `cursor/arch-migrate-<slice>-ca70` or `cursor/refactor-<ctx>-<topic>-ca70` (lowercase; suffix `-ca70` on Cloud Agent).
- **Commit** each completed slice; **push**; create/update PR with accurate title (branch name may be legacy-narrow).

## Hard stops

- No `@/legacy/**`, Tier B tables/columns, `apps/web`, monorepo packages without explicit instruction.
- No whole-repo format/lint drive-by.
